{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"The representation reports unavailable executable meaning, so aggregation, the inclusive 50% threshold, exclusions, designation logic, and unsupported restrictions or permissions cannot be inspected. This alone establishes no substantive implementation defect.\",\"Designation factors inform the SFC's holistic assessment; they are not automatic triggers or substitutes for an operative designation. Footnote 7 addresses assessment below 50% of NAV.\",\"Missing classification evidence must remain distinguishable from established absence of a classification basis. A false result establishes neither historical declassification nor permission to distribute; excluded LAFs are not thereby non-complex.\",\"The 15% direct-investment limit in footnote 1 is separate from the aggregate 50% classification threshold. The supplied source does not establish exposure valuation, double-counting methodology, designation expiry, or automatic declassification.\",\"Additional external texts absent from the packet include UT Code section 7.3, the LAF circular 25EC9, Internal Product Approval Process guidance 16EC11, and the Advertising Guidelines identified in footnote 10. Their wider regimes are outside this question; their absence does not defeat locally supported claims.\",\"The three unbound dependency IDs contain no authority-identifying metadata. No mapping to named missing authorities is established.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular itself supplies this designation factor.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.8b9221b121dedba945c1b7af\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Executable treatment of this factor is unavailable.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"UNAVAILABLE_EXECUTABLE_MEANING: E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE; Unsupported operator or arity: +\"],\"status\":\"UNASSESSED\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}],\"question_hash\":\"94c664f95c85ee3b7684395544a2591ace34782c3c2c2d8b058029bd619c0a90\",\"rationale\":\"Informs the designation route without independently establishing designation.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets of the Fund;\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u22.4078\"},{\"quote\":\"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}],\"rationale\":\"Exposure is a discretionary consideration; the below-50% qualification creates no separate automatic threshold.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular expressly defines the term.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.8c3e8f5b273c84c361a6b058\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Executable asset categorisation cannot be inspected.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"UNAVAILABLE_EXECUTABLE_MEANING: E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE; Unsupported operator or arity: +\"],\"status\":\"UNASSESSED\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}],\"question_hash\":\"94c664f95c85ee3b7684395544a2591ace34782c3c2c2d8b058029bd619c0a90\",\"rationale\":\"Defines the assets entering the exposure assessment.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"private credit and private 